# Prismatic Omen: "Lands you control are every basic land type in addition to their other types." CR 305.7's last sentence:
# a land that gains land types in addition to its own keeps its land types and rules text and gains each new type's mana
# ability (CR 305.6). So Bot1's Mutavault is a Plains Island Swamp Mountain Forest that taps for {U} (a mana ability it never
# had) and still has "{T}: Add {C}" and its animation, which Bot1 activates (it becomes a 2/2). The ruling: name and
# supertypes are unchanged, so it is no basic land and Bot1's Forest stays a basic one. Bot2's Island is not Bot1's to
# change ("you control"): it is only an Island and taps for no {G}. A Mountain of Bot1's is now a Forest too, which Utopia
# Sprawl ("Enchant Forest") may enchant; before the Omen it could not (the refusal and its positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mutavault
Mox Emerald
Prismatic Omen
Utopia Sprawl
Mountain
Plains
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Utopia Sprawl.Cast(Mountain)
Bot1.Hand.Prismatic Omen.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Forest; Island; Mountain; Plains; Swamp
? Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Utopia Sprawl.Cast(Mountain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Colors(Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate(Ability: Add {R})
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: becomes a 2/2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Types = Land; Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Power = 2
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
? Bot2.Mana = {U}

[Expect]
Turn = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Utopia Sprawl.AttachedTo = Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Subtypes = Forest; Island; Mountain; Plains; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Supertypes = Basic
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Supertypes = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Island
